

Kev-pab-cuam-khoos-phis-tawj tu-kom-huv.


>> Veggy := Yam-khoom tshiab.
Veggy thaum-tuaj: ['tshiab'] ua: {
	>> v := tus-kheej tshiab.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy thaum-tuaj: ['init'] ua: { nws-li veggies := 0. }.

Veggy thaum-tuaj: ['carrots:'] ua: { :a nws-li veggies := a. <- Tsis-muaj-dabtsi. }.
Veggy thaum-tuaj: ['carrots'] ua: { <- nws-li veggies. }.
Veggy thaum-tuaj: ['+'] ua: { :f
	>> n := Veggy tshiab.
	n carrots: (f carrots + nws-li veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy thaum-tuaj: ['kab-ntawv'] ua: { <- nws-li veggies kab-ntawv.
}.

Lej thaum-tuaj: ['carrots'] ua: {
	>> x := Veggy tshiab.
	x carrots: tus-kheej. <- x.
}.

Lej thaum-tuaj: ['add:and:'] ua: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Tawm sau-ntawv: q, kab-tshiab.
